      "content": "but what if there is no pattern to change? what if this is just how it is? lately it just feels like the only way to actually stop the cycle is to just... not be here. to just have everything stop. it seems way more logical than this constant, agonizing struggle that always ends the same way. it's like the only way to win is to just exit the game.",
